<title>SYRIA: Gunfire in Damascus to celebrate Ramadan.</title>
<headline>Gunfire in Damascus to celebrate Ramadan.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gun shots were fired in the air in Damascus on Thursday to celebrate the announcement of the start of the Moslem fasting month of Ramadan.</p>
<p>An official statement said Ramadan would start in Syria on Friday.</p>
</text>
